      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/3153-minimum-cone-radius\n\nHand resolutions:\n- mcp/edit.rs: keep main's wire taper read-back and the PR's opt-in\n  (false/zero) read-back; keep main's pass_start branch.\n- motion chamfer.rs: keep the PR's tip-offset branch; keep main's\n  side comment and guard; the guard index uses saturating_sub.\n- project file: main is at v78, so the tip offset becomes v79 (was v74\n  on the PR); migration note and legacy test move to v78 -> v79.\n- examples: take main's version lines; the 4-axis example saves v79.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
