      },
      "message": "fix(chamfer): refuse partial offsets and preserve legacy paths\n\nCheck every selected closed boundary span after an offset, including branch and inlet collapses that preserve loop count. Restore the exact legacy zero-offset depth on closed and open routes, pinned by captured complete Toolpaths.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The tip-offset feature saves project format v79. Readers supporting v78 cannot open v79 projects and must be upgraded.\n\nRefs #3153",
