        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-25T03:24:49Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/3153-minimum-cone-radius\n\nRefresh for merge (maintainer side, maintainer edits allowed). Hand edits:\n- crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs: main split the opt-in probe (probe_kept, flag_kept\n  with a strict `true` check); this PR added numeric opt-ins. Kept both:\n  opt_in_kept probes `true` for booleans (must come back `true`) and `1.0`\n  for numbers (must come back).\n- Project version: main's #3368 took v79 as the tip-form step and a const\n  assert forbids PROJECT_VERSION == 79. This PR's step is now v80 (file.rs,\n  apply.rs migration note, the 4-axis example, the decision note).\n- tests/project_roundtrip.rs (#3368 test): the const assert that the tip-form\n  step is above PROJECT_VERSION goes; a tip-form file now says\n  written_project_version(true), still >= the tip-form version.\n- chamfer_minimum_radius.rs and heights_note_tests.rs: main's new Tool\n  fields (tip_form, tip_diameter) and OpParams `picks`, at their defaults.\n\nQuick gate vs upstream/main: 1209 steps, 0 failed, clippy clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
